# PSR-5e2 — PLATFORM_BILLING cluster migrate

## Files (4)

| File | Pattern |
| --- | --- |
| `platform-subscription.repository.ts` | `defaultPrisma()` via require |
| `mark-tenant-subscription-paid.ts` | direct `getPrismaAdmin()` |
| `update-tenant-subscription.ts` | direct |
| `process-past-due-subscriptions.ts` | direct |

All switch to `getPlatformAdminClient(PLATFORM_ADMIN_REASON.PLATFORM_BILLING)`.
Injectable `constructor(prisma?)` on the repository is unchanged — only the
default factory uses the named client.

## Non-goals

- Lifecycle / impersonation / provision clusters
- Changing subscription business logic

## Ratchet

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-5e-platform-admin-capability-smoke.mjs
```

`remaining_direct` must be **23** (29 − 2 pilot − 4 billing).
